      "note_before": "BLOCKED PRIVATE PROTOTYPE: not an application-ready create. The existing UNMAPPED_0118 Columbia_Blood_Agar_Base owner contains authentic generic, Oxoid CM331 and BD-Difco lineage; its history and occurrences cannot be repurposed to this Oxoid-only identity. A genuine reviewed published source-owner partition and coupling are required before installation. The prototype unites only the supported nominal dry Oxoid formulation from CM0331 and TOGO M2224; it does not backfill CM0331 as the historical M2224 purchase code, assert exact lot composition, or equate BBL42.5 g/Difco44 g alternatives. The four-part list is COMPLETE relative to the typical published formula, not a claim of chemical specification of peptone or every moisture/lot constituent. No water or blood is a dry-base component. The original source labels remain in case provenance. No whole maintained owner history is copied into this genuinely new proposed source-specific owner. Original published proposal files and their full source cases, occurrences, evidence and historical assertions are immutable in family-reconciliations-v1. Historical proposal events below describe original isolated proposals, not maintained applications. Their former identity/quantity choices are superseded only by this explicitly documented private reconciliation. No current owner or corpus count is modified.",
